5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We need a sustainable system. I suggest we look into the costs and the records first.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We should determine the actual time commitment before deciding on a structure.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Logic suggests we examine the usage patterns and the current distribution of labor.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I just want the rooms to be consistently clean. Let's see why the quality varies so much.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I hope we can find a way that keeps us all happy and friendly.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, which specific data points do you think would clarify the time commitment?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,The stopwatch timing and perhaps the outside firm's terms to see the professional baseline.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I'll look into the kitchen use and the wall calendar to see who is actually here.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"I'll check what everyone counts as ""done"" and the state of the bathroom grout.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I'll look at the house chat rows and the note from the previous tenants.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will handle the spray receipts and the management office rate sheet.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,That covers the basics. I'm set on my choices.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,Me too.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,Sounds like a plan.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
