35,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"We are spending about 2,300 yen monthly on supplies, often duplicating items. Professional cleaning is 4,200 yen per hour.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,A full pass takes about 102 minutes. An outside firm requires us to tidy up before they even arrive.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Usage is uneven; a few people do most of the cooking. Also, some of us are away frequently.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The bathroom grout spoils in eleven days regardless of effort. Also, our definitions of ""clean"" are completely different.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,Previous tenants tried permanent assignments and stopped speaking. Most of our fights start with reminders.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Benjamin, if usage is uneven, a flat split of labor might be seen as unfair.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@May, if the bathroom degrades that quickly, a weekly rota might be too infrequent.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,Exactly. The current system ignores that some people barely use the space.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"It's frustrating. We're cleaning differently, so the result is always a gamble.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,We must avoid permanent assignments if we want to stay friends.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"A paid service would remove the labor dispute, but we must manage the billing carefully.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"If we have to tidy before a professional arrives, does it actually save us that much time?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It saves the deep scrubbing, which is the most contentious part.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,I'd pay to not have to guess if the bathroom is actually clean.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,A professional service might remove the need for those nagging reminders.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Toshio,,It seems the most neutral path.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,It's a rational way to outsource the stress.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I can support that, provided the cost is split fairly.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,I'm all for it.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I agree, it protects our harmony.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
